{"query":"Search for the original PRINCIPLE trial primary report (e.g., Lancet or medRxiv preprint) evaluating ivermectin for COVID-19 in community adults, rather than news summaries or secondary reviews.","results":[{"position":1,"site_name":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","snippet":"The evidence for whether ivermectin impacts recovery, hospital admissions, and longer-term outcomes in COVID-19 is contested. The WHO recommends its use only in the context of clinical trials. In this multicentre, open-label, multi-arm, adaptive ...","title":"Ivermectin for COVID-19 in adults in the community (PRINCIPLE ...","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10981761/"},{"position":2,"site_name":"www.principletrial.org","snippet":"The analysis included 2,157 participants receiving ivermectin plus usual NHS care, compared with 3,256 participants receiving usual NHS care alone. Research paper: Ivermectin for COVID-19 in adults in the community (PRINCIPLE): an open, randomised, controlled, adaptive platform trial of short- and longer-term outcomes","title":"Results — PRINCIPLE Trial","url":"https://www.principletrial.org/results"},{"position":3,"site_name":"www.journalofinfection.com","snippet":"Ivermectin for COVID-19 is unlikely to provide clinically meaningful improvement in recovery, hospital admissions, or longer-term outcomes. Further trials of ivermectin for SARS-Cov-2 infection in vaccinated community populations appear unwarranted.","title":"Ivermectin for COVID-19 in adults in the community (PRINCIPLE ...","url":"https://www.journalofinfection.com/article/S0163-4453%2824%2900064-1/fulltext"},{"date":"Feb 29, 2024","position":4,"site_name":"www.journalofinfection.com","snippet":"Methods Trial design We assessed the effectiveness of ivermectin in the UK national, multi-centre, primary care, open-label, multi-arm, prospective adaptive Platform Randomised trial of Treatments in the Community for Pandemic and Epidemic Illnesses (PRINCIPLE), which opened on April 2, 2020, and closed to recruitment on July 1, 2022.","title":"Ivermectin for COVID-19 in adults in the community (PRINCIPLE ...","url":"https://www.journalofinfection.com/article/S0163-4453(24)00064-1/pdf"},{"position":5,"site_name":"www.principletrial.org","snippet":"This section dives into the PRINCIPLE trial's specific methodology and comprehensive data on ivermectin's effectiveness, following participants for up to 12 months post-treatment in community settings. It aims to offer an objective, evidence-based overview of this repurposed drug's potential role.","title":"Examining the Evidence: Ivermectin and COVID-19 in the ...","url":"https://www.principletrial.org/principle-a-guide/examining-the-evidence-ivermectin-and-covid-19-in-the-principle-trial"},{"position":6,"site_name":"www.thelancet.com","snippet":"As COVID-19 evolved in early 2020, several crucial issues for public health became apparent, including the need to reduce pressure on secondary care through effective treatment in the community for those at highest risk of hospital admission. PRINCIPLE, which began in April, 2020, was designed to test multiple therapeutic candidates efficiently using a master protocol within a platform trial.1 ...","title":"PRINCIPLE: a community-based COVID-19 platform trial - The Lancet","url":"https://www.thelancet.com/journals/lanres/article/PIIS2213-2600(21)00360-X/fulltext"},{"date":"Feb 1, 2024","position":7,"site_name":"www.researchgate.net","snippet":"Interpretation Ivermectin for COVID-19 is unlikely to provide clinically meaningful improvement in recovery, hospital admissions, or longer-term outcomes.","title":"Ivermectin for COVID-19 in adults in the community (PRINCIPLE ...","url":"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/378627431_Ivermectin_for_COVID-19_in_adults_in_the_community_PRINCIPLE_an_open_randomised_controlled_adaptive_platform_trial_of_short-_and_longer-term_outcomes"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}